    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG102 · Chapter 2 · Session 13</span>\n<h2>Session 13 — SYMBOLS — Symbol libraries; Creating symbols; Editing symbols; Applying a symbol instance; Breaking link to symbol; Symbol sprayer tool</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13371 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG102 · Chương 2 · Buổi 13</span>\n<h2>Buổi 13 — SYMBOLS — Symbol libraries; Creating symbols; Editing symbols; Applying a symbol instance; Breaking link to symbol; Symbol sprayer tool</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13371 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>SYMBOLS — Symbol libraries; Creating symbols; Editing symbols; Applying a symbol instance; Breaking link to symbol; Symbol sprayer tool</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives (5 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the session number in the deck name. File: Session 13_DTG102_Course objectives.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives (5 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số buổi ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: Session 13_DTG102_Course objectives.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d13/001.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 1: USING THE SYMBOL TOOLS\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 1/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>USING THE SYMBOL TOOLS</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d13/002.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 2: Creating a New Symbol\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 2/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Creating a New Symbol<br>Once you have created your graphic, select and drag it to to Symbols Palette<br>(Window&gt;Symbols). Click OK to confirm.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d13/003.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 3: Symbol Sprayer Tools\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 3/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Symbol Sprayer Tools<br>Next select, the Symbol Sprayer Tool. You can double click on the Symbol Spray  Tool to open up the Symbolism Tools Options. In the options you can change the  diameter or intensity of sprayer.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d13/004.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 4: With the Symbol Sprayer Tool, click and drag to create new instances of your symbol.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 4/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>With the Symbol Sprayer Tool, click and drag to create new instances of your symbol.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d13/005.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 5: Expanding Symbol Objects\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 13 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 5/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Expanding Symbol Objects<br>If you need to expand the symbols objects to paths, you can go the Symbols  Palette and choose Break Link to Symbol.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
