    "description": "Buổi 17 theo syllabus FLM · 4 slide.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG102 · Chapter 2 · Session 17</span>\n<h2>Session 17 — 3D OBJECTS — 3D Extrude &amp; Bevel; Modifying 3D object; Mapping artwork to 3D object; Lighting and Shadows for 3D Objects</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13371 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG102 · Chương 2 · Buổi 17</span>\n<h2>Buổi 17 — 3D OBJECTS — 3D Extrude &amp; Bevel; Modifying 3D object; Mapping artwork to 3D object; Lighting and Shadows for 3D Objects</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13371 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>3D OBJECTS — 3D Extrude &amp; Bevel; Modifying 3D object; Mapping artwork to 3D object; Lighting and Shadows for 3D Objects</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives (4 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the session number in the deck name. File: Session 17_DTG102_Course objectives.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives (4 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số buổi ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: Session 17_DTG102_Course objectives.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d17/001.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 1: SPECIAL EFFECTS\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 1/4</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>SPECIAL EFFECTS</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d17/002.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 2: Raster Effects\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 2/4</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Raster Effects<br>There are some effects that uses raster effects instead of vector. This includes all of the  effects in the bottom section of the Effect menu, and the Drop Shadow, Inner Glow,  Outer Glow. When you apply raster effects, it uses the resolution in your raster settings  which you can set it under Effect&gt;Document Raster Effects Settings. Raster Effects are  not considered as vector as it contains high resolution bitmap.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d17/003.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 3: Round Corners (Effect&gt;Stylize&gt;Round Corners)\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 3/4</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Round Corners (Effect&gt;Stylize&gt;Round Corners)<br>Round Corners is very useful in making smooth corners from sharp angles. You  can set the Radius to adjust the amount of smoothness you need for the corners.  It can add style to your icons and making your illustrations appear more natural.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DTG102/flm1/d17/004.webp\" alt=\"DTG102 · Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 4: Warp Options\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"990\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 17 DTG102 Course objectives · slide 4/4</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Warp Options<br>It can make you text stand out from the crowd by distorting it using arc, fisheye  and wave effects. It can also bend bend boring lines to curves. Something to  spend time experimenting with.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
