    "title": "📑 Session 26 — PHOTOSHOP INTERFACE — UI Elements; Customization; Navigation: Zooming, panning. ORGANIZING FILES — Crea…|||📑 Buổi 26 — PHOTOSHOP INTERFACE — UI Elements; Customization; Navigation: Zooming, panning. ORGANIZING FILES — Create…",
